# Package only what runs and what the store pages show: the built extension, worker, wasm, webview and notices,
# the icon, README, CHANGELOG and licence. package.json is always included. Screenshots stay out: the README links
# to them by absolute URL.
# vsce lets any "!" pattern win over the ignores, so list the kept files by type rather than excluding source maps.
**
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!LICENSE.txt
!media/*.svg
!media/*.png
!dist/*.cjs
!dist/*.wasm
!dist/*.txt
!dist/webview/*.js
!dist/webview/*.mjs
!dist/webview/*.css
